Compilation Details
Compile the document using pdflatex or xelatex. Ensure standard packages (geometry, amsmath, amssymb, amsfonts, booktabs, listings, xcolor, titlesec, fancyhdr, and tikz with shapes.geometric, arrows, and positioning libraries) are installed in your TeX environment.
